  "notes": "The fighter a TL9 navy can build. Its manoeuvre drive only cruises; a reaction booster gives it thrust 6 for two hours of combat, and then it has to go home. Its one firmpoint carries a missile rack in a fixed mount, since a firmpoint would cut a laser to close range, and a cockpit: the pilot lives aboard the carrier."
